#
# Architecture: the page owns ONE GET /analytics/fleet read (web useFleetAnalytics) and feeds every tab
# from it — the self-fetching Hero/Overview/Charging surfaces are replayed through their own result mappers
# (Replay{HeroGauges,OverviewTab,ChargingTab}Source), and the presentational Driving/Battery surfaces are
# handed models parsed from the same snapshot (AnalyticsProjection.Build{Driving,Battery}Model). The four
# tab bodies (Overview/Driving/Charging/Battery) and HeroGauges are each their own already-shipped parity
# unit; this W7 unit is the page shell (header + 3 states + 4 tab labels) per the manifest record
# (dataSources=[useFleetAnalytics], states=[loading,error,success], strings=[analytics.{title,subtitle,
# tabs.overview,tabs.driving,tabs.charging,tabs.battery}], requiredCount=9, no panels/charts/maps).

